OL,3,GNEWSAPlans approved for Shredded Wheat
OL,4,Afactory site
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been approved to redevelop
OL,7,Fthe former Shredded Wheat factory into
OL,8,Fover 500 new homes and other buildings.
OL,10,FThe site opened 100 years ago off
OL,11,FBroadwater Road in Welwyn Garden City,
OL,12,FHertfordshire, and closed in 2008 when
OL,13,Fproduction stopped.
OL,15,FWelwyn Hatfield Borough Council has
OL,16,Fgranted planning permission for the
OL,17,Fscheme, called the "Wheat Quarter".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
