OL,3,GNEWSAPlans approved for Shredded Wheat
OL,4,Afactory site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour leader of the authority and
OL,7,Fexecutive member for planning, Rose
OL,8,FGrewal, said it would "bring a
OL,9,Flong-vacant site back into use" and
OL,10,F"provide new homes and investment".
